<title>USA: VASCO Corp to sell consulting unit.</title>
<headline>VASCO Corp to sell consulting unit.</headline>
<dateline>LOMBARD, Ill. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>VASCO Corp said on Tuesday that it has signed an agreement to sell the assets of its VASCO Performance Systems consulting and technical training unit to Wizdom Systems Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>VASCO said the sale to Naperville, Illinois-based Wizdom will allow VASCO to concentrate on its information security operations.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
